1
00:00:02,476 --> 00:00:05,035
Over a thousand patents stamped under my name

2
00:00:05,085 --> 00:00:07,558
I lit up New York City while you chased a phantom flame

3
00:00:07,608 --> 00:00:09,970
You wired up the future? Boy, you couldn't pay the rent

4
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:13,160
Feeding pigeons in a hotel without a single cent

5
00:00:15,444 --> 00:00:17,902
Twenty-two men built the bulb before you made the steal

6
00:00:17,952 --> 00:00:20,760
You promised fifty thousand bucks then broke the whole deal

7
00:00:20,808 --> 00:00:23,145
Your weak direct current left the city in the dark

8
00:00:23,195 --> 00:00:26,109
Now the future drives my name on every high-voltage spark

